  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
    "3. Add chickpeas to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "4. Thread chickpeas, parsley, and harmonious herb blend onto skewers.",
